    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is simple: Complete the mission. Each day, you wake up with a new mission, forced to descend into a strange and deadly building, called The Monolith. Before each mission, you are able to choose to bring a weapon, and a tool. You must communicate with your team to ensure you have the right tools for the job. Along the way, you will need to scavenge for resources to keep you going, as well as new weapons and tools. <br><br>Play in either ENDLESS mode or WORKWEEK mode. ENDLESS mode will continue on forever, challenging you and your team to see just how much you can handle. <br>WORKWEEK mode is a set of 10 missions, each given out weekly. Everyone playing has the exact same missions for the week, so you can strategize with the community to find the best tactics to succeed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151700/extras/a82d4ff8d6167992d1d4fbae12aa3023.avif?t=1753279684\" width=600 height=72 /></span>Work together to ensure survival. Teamwork is the <i>only way</i> to survive the dangers that roam within. One wrong move is all it takes for things to go wrong, and for your team to die.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151700/extras/770752c12649d18429a64cedd124d7fd.avif?t=1753279684\" width=600 height=72 /></span>Coordinate and plan ahead before taking action. Always assume the worst, and use every tool at your disposal. A team without a plan will be quickly killed, as the dangers waiting below are relentless and won't hesitate to rip you apart. Ensure you have backup plans for when things go wrong. Which they will. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151700/extras/780695531a5b91ad26d487868c7c7ae3.avif?t=1753279684\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The insides of the Monolith are a frantic, unpredictable monstrosity. Every single time you play, things will be different. There will always be something you didn't see coming, so you will need to think quickly when things don't go according to plan.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is simple: Complete the mission. Each day, you wake up with a new mission, forced to descend into a strange and deadly building, called The Monolith. Before each mission, you are able to choose to bring a weapon, and a tool. You must communicate with your team to ensure you have the right tools for the job. Along the way, you will need to scavenge for resources to keep you going, as well as new weapons and tools. <br><br>Play in either ENDLESS mode or WORKWEEK mode. ENDLESS mode will continue on forever, challenging you and your team to see just how much you can handle. <br>WORKWEEK mode is a set of 10 missions, each given out weekly. Everyone playing has the exact same missions for the week, so you can strategize with the community to find the best tactics to succeed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151700/extras/a82d4ff8d6167992d1d4fbae12aa3023.avif?t=1753279684\" width=600 height=72 /></span>Work together to ensure survival. Teamwork is the <i>only way</i> to survive the dangers that roam within. One wrong move is all it takes for things to go wrong, and for your team to die.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151700/extras/770752c12649d18429a64cedd124d7fd.avif?t=1753279684\" width=600 height=72 /></span>Coordinate and plan ahead before taking action. Always assume the worst, and use every tool at your disposal. A team without a plan will be quickly killed, as the dangers waiting below are relentless and won't hesitate to rip you apart. Ensure you have backup plans for when things go wrong. Which they will. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151700/extras/780695531a5b91ad26d487868c7c7ae3.avif?t=1753279684\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The insides of the Monolith are a frantic, unpredictable monstrosity. Every single time you play, things will be different. There will always be something you didn't see coming, so you will need to think quickly when things don't go according to plan.</p>",
    "short_description": "DEEPWATER is a frantic, hardcore 4 player co-op shooter where every decision counts. Scavenge tools and supplies while attempting to complete the mission assigned to your team, while coming face to face with death each step of the way.",
